---
const pains = [
  {
    n: '01',
    title: 'Configs are guesswork',
    body: 'Context length, batch size, precision, memory share, parallelism. Dozens of engine flags, and the defaults are tuned for nobody’s workload.',
  },
  {
    n: '02',
    title: 'Quality breaks silently',
    body: 'A quantized build is faster and breaks tool calls. Nothing errors. Your agents just get worse, and you find out from users.',
  },
  {
    n: '03',
    title: 'Every update is a risk',
    body: 'Swapping a model or changing a setting in production has no canary and no automatic way back.',
  },
  {
    n: '04',
    title: 'Spend is invisible',
    body: 'GPUs sit idle at full price. Nobody can say what a million tokens costs, or whether self-hosting beats the API bill.',
  },
];
---
<section class="section" id="problem">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">The problem</span>
      <h2 class="h-section">Self-hosting LLMs became a tuning job nobody signed up for.</h2>
      <p class="lede">
        Teams move to open models for cost, privacy and control. Then they spend weeks on engine flags, out-of-memory
        errors and silent regressions instead of shipping product.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="pains">
      {pains.map((p, i) => (
        <article class="card pain reveal" style={`transition-delay:${i * 70}ms`}>
          <span class="n">{p.n}</span>
          <h3>{p.title}</h3>
          <p>{p.body}</p>
        </article>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .pains { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 16px; }
  .pain { padding: 28px 24px 30px; }
  .n { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--fg-3); }
  h3 { margin: 40px 0 10px; font-size: 19px; letter-spacing: -0.02em; font-weight: 600; }
  p { margin: 0; color: var(--fg-2); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; }
  @media (max-width: 1000px) { .pains { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; } }
  @media (max-width: 600px) { .pains { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>
